function page(name){if((running||saving)&&name!=='studio'){toast(saving?'正在保存本次练习，请稍候。':'正在录音，请先点击“结束并分析”，保存本次练习。');return;}document.querySelectorAll('.page').forEach(e=>e.hidden=e.id!==name);document.querySelectorAll('.nav').forEach(e=>e.classList.toggle('active',e.dataset.page===name));if(name==='history')renderHistory();window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'smooth'});}
